    {
      "id": "BufferPoint#vertexCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bdd8905c40f4a63be469c5353ba48efa44089e5fa2a6ecdebcef68b5ffc9ef2f",
      "text": "此图元的位置（顶点）数量，始终为 1。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPoint",
      "field": "classdesc",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d807b7083764445a5f3f601631f44ff01f699704cf19d646dc09a85990417544",
      "text": "绑定 {@link BufferPointCollection} 底层缓冲数据的视图。\n<p>BufferPoint 实例采用{@link https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flyweight_pattern|享元模式}：同一实例可临时绑定到集合中的任意概念点，从而以很低的内存开销遍历和更新大型集合。</p>\n一个点由一个位置表示。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointCollection#add",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6996322b12c94d617c0155e01f8585338954ae353b1e800030913e5d347c986d",
      "text": "按给定选项向集合添加点，并将 {@link BufferPoint} 实例绑定到该点。提供 result 时使用该实例，否则新建实例。重复调用时，建议复用同一个 BufferPoint，避免每次分配新对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointCollection",
      "field": "classdesc",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:11832353d8d31d80ef0180fd45c2961883d5417ada45ac18abeefebfe40c40bd",
      "text": "采用 ArrayBuffer 存储的点集合，以优化性能和内存。\n<p>默认缓冲分配量为任意预设值，集合不可扩容；已知所需容量时，应在构造函数中指定各缓冲的容量。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointCollection",
      "field": "params/options.allowPicking/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9ce763ef285c13b875762085c046766a054ebffdc7a7bd643de4592301d030ff",
      "text": "为 <code>true</code> 时，可通过 {@link Scene#pick} 拾取图元；为 <code>false</code> 时可降低内存与初始化开销。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointCollection",
      "field": "params/options.boundingVolume/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d6451397396b58cc25178ab6bffa5a9069b8112fbf76ec15dde8b1b9aa6b8a88",
      "text": "集合的世界空间包围体。未指定时，自动计算并在图元位置变化时更新；已指定时，由用户按需更新。大型动态集合可通过预先计算包围体并仅在必要时更新来提高性能。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointCollection",
      "field": "params/options.modelMatrix/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dafdae78f13684907f6f9a43b6291a8d915022921f941ea13135302a75c734e9",
      "text": "将几何从模型坐标变换到世界坐标。"
    },
    {
