      "text": "点尺寸，范围为 0～255 像素。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointMaterial#toJSON",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f1e91e8bd3ebdaef4b4115a45b8fec2a7492a7142fb6184587b109df436f097e",
      "text": "返回表示此材质的可 JSON 序列化对象。这种编码内存效率较低，通常仅用于调试和测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPointMaterial#toJSON",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:38ce205350a51431dad373a20e64971e370f07ce01ccbec8481ed4f8bfc08e63",
