    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon.clone",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:706cc11884fee2ca0bde4844c0309c8ab42edd1ccf45528b877040fccf18768f",
      "text": "将源多边形数据复制到 result。如果结果多边形不是集合末尾的新多边形，则源与结果必须具有相同的顶点数、孔洞数和三角形数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#featureId",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:802bcb9cd1068dfff9ea3eed90c52b8e86e1ef78099062247a82861e35d78a09",
      "text": "与图元关联的要素 ID，无需唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getHolePositions",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2d3260c6925ff442661f972272934443c2cf96ad515c8555a0e2c70df90acbac",
      "text": "返回指定孔洞内环顶点位置的数组视图。提供 result 时，将顶点位置写入该数组并返回；否则返回集合内存上的 ArrayView。直接修改此数组不会触发渲染更新，须调用 `.setPositions()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getHolePositions",
      "field": "params/result/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2df27ce78f7397a409896ac0cfd6ddf8185c84a3924df886d0b4f877ca4d3959",
      "text": "用于接收结果的数组，结果类型为 TypedArray。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getHoles",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:54967ee4451b0424f840b25ca1bf81cad8e12968e0ee8f5223e5fe6d16527d80",
      "text": "获取多边形的孔洞索引。每个孔洞用相对此多边形位置数组的起始偏移表示，并沿内环延续至下一个孔洞偏移或位置数组末尾。提供 result 时，将索引写入该数组并返回；否则返回集合内存上的 ArrayView。直接修改此数组不会触发渲染更新，须调用 `.setHoles()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getHoleVertexCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:edf0b800beb5991adb82578203e3f8de35cdec76d126a17f9fa04300e3cc7f10",
      "text": "返回指定孔洞的 VEC3 顶点数量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getOuterPositions",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f73e55fbf45b405a05671a03c3f9501206210fa09de806a5d7d5060a9aa5a304",
      "text": "返回多边形外环顶点位置的数组视图。提供 result 时，将顶点位置写入该数组并返回；否则返回集合内存上的 ArrayView。直接修改此数组不会触发渲染更新，须调用 `.setPositions()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getPositions",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:08914254daea353008559bbf0b1040190e19d9cabaf1ef1fb79aefdd9fbeae9f",
      "text": "返回多边形顶点位置的数组视图。提供 result 时，将顶点位置写入该数组并返回；否则返回集合内存上的 ArrayView。直接修改此数组不会触发渲染更新，须调用 `.setPositions()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getPositions",
      "field": "params/result/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2df27ce78f7397a409896ac0cfd6ddf8185c84a3924df886d0b4f877ca4d3959",
      "text": "用于接收结果的数组，结果类型为 TypedArray。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#getTriangles",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:909e68dc8f4a74555c83752264d0c5cddec9f25f90a41ee38ea5c20b2187d895",
      "text": "返回多边形三角形索引的数组视图，每个三角形由三个顶点索引表示。提供 result 时，将索引写入该数组并返回；否则返回集合内存上的 ArrayView。直接修改此数组不会触发渲染更新，须调用 `.setTriangles()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#holeCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1132f13334e75e0bcb8db94688c872cf7b5f3f749a20a5dab168b43e0b0fe827",
      "text": "多边形的孔洞数量，即孔洞索引数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#outerVertexCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:582dfe35dbd7e5f5f95f82552b1ce840441eeb69cc7032da283d7ac4b7e842eb",
      "text": "多边形外环的位置（顶点）数量，以 VEC3 元素计。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#outerVertexOffset",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:35415fb89555aeeb28e4c9d371d74b3e39a92c8b6c01f14becb495216244761a",
      "text": "多边形外环首顶点在集合位置数组中的偏移，以 VEC3 元素计。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#setHoles",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:057eafb9729e55c577c1df47821ea03e5355ed6d2c55bb8ff7405876ac638512",
      "text": "设置多边形孔洞索引。每个孔洞用相对此多边形位置数组的起始偏移表示，并沿内环延续至下一个孔洞偏移或位置数组末尾。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#setTriangles",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:247f0d6ed8d1503f87f73b79038c83ee242ebf94508c3256268da0306a6be347",
      "text": "设置多边形三角形索引，每个三角形由三个顶点索引表示。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#show",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3bf601cfd6b731bed0a629e4628d36b5ec1b1852f633787b1272f05f7866aff2",
      "text": "是否显示图元。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#toJSON",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:4ff2e03a530bab81c199a8404e786a9da87ba8747f69bbf9ba64799e5ed3987e",
      "text": "返回表示此多边形的可 JSON 序列化对象。这种编码内存效率较低，通常仅用于调试和测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#toJSON",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:38ce205350a51431dad373a20e64971e370f07ce01ccbec8481ed4f8bfc08e63",
      "text": "可 JSON 序列化的对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#triangleCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dc3ee1251d4c3a79b3919901da2a54fcee247057aad22f0a5b53c34bc62fa368",
      "text": "多边形三角形数量，以 VEC3 索引元素计。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon#vertexCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0a1f79abd520fe52f5a31720e59a06e9a3580eabcc249aa8fddebb4b654d4645",
      "text": "多边形的位置（顶点）数量，包括外环及所有内环孔洞，以 VEC3 元素计。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygon",
      "field": "classdesc",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c195bc2c6f3a2d33f750bfd323ccf1eeefc3c661997ddd0269d5b53dfb26a207",
      "text": "绑定 {@link BufferPolygonCollection} 底层缓冲数据的视图。\n<p>BufferPolygon 实例采用{@link https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flyweight_pattern|享元模式}：同一实例可临时绑定到集合中的任意概念多边形，从而以很低的内存开销遍历和更新大型集合。</p>\n<p>多边形包含一个由至少三个位置组成的外线性环，并可包含一个或多个内线性环（孔洞）。每个孔洞用位置数组中的起始顶点索引表示，从该顶点延续至下一个孔洞起点或顶点列表末尾。还存储预先计算的三角剖分，每个三角形由三个顶点索引表示。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection.clone",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:95d10ce958a601853f96dead9377596917b27482217fccde93c88c95690d702a",
      "text": "将集合内容复制到结果集合。结果集合不会扩容，必须有足够空间容纳源集合全部图元；已有多边形将被覆盖。\n<p>适合在集合达到容量后分配更大集合，并高效地将多边形转移到新集合。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection#add",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e4269324860f7a51ca3780c62a5ef415c6b1fa7fcc09ad7b0d0e3d0586e4c02e",
      "text": "按给定选项向集合添加多边形，并将 {@link BufferPolygon} 实例绑定到该多边形。提供 result 时使用该实例，否则新建实例。重复调用时，建议复用同一个 BufferPolygon，避免每次分配新对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection#byteLength",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b9b07c9e8a7dd074162f7d0a0111e908be5a71eb1d5807a2015ab0d1c98cfe4b",
      "text": "集合拥有的全部缓冲的总字节数，包括 {@link primitiveCountMax} 分配的尚未使用空间，即使尚未在该空间添加多边形。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection#holeCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3bb8cec7976ce418868d28ebff949156d761fd802765ffc0b576810433f097ab",
      "text": "集合中的孔洞数量，必须小于等于 {@link holeCountMax}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection#holeCountMax",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d3b0e1e545d09d713d4fad3c4f60b557202a8945627a9a069575dd62ce09ec24",
      "text": "集合可容纳的最大孔洞数量，必须大于等于 {@link holeCount}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection#triangleCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:09e0b9a82e89b6b5753f2f4618a07f8d8bebe99f8b7f63533a5c0de76391f9d8",
      "text": "集合中的三角形数量，必须小于等于 {@link triangleCountMax}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection#triangleCountMax",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:50e0012842b519a523b4b8db45db01882108e7e9e0a3a993901bc1b30ef82126",
      "text": "集合可容纳的最大三角形数量，必须大于等于 {@link triangleCount}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPolygonCollection",
      "field": "classdesc",
