    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitive",
      "field": "classdesc",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a7ab081070217b4609a116a4b59f5ef4cfe7c596c1d557d647b967cd53332503",
      "text": "绑定 {@link BufferPrimitiveCollection} 底层缓冲数据的抽象视图。\n<p>遍历大型集合时，应复用 BufferPrimitive 实例：在读写某图元前将实例临时绑定到该图元索引，之后再绑定到下一个图元。这采用了{@link https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flyweight_pattern|享元模式}。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection.clone",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:842c7532224f9aad2ab19c65ed08f878a70a6c319f904f5dbebd75db7c8a81ee",
      "text": "将集合内容复制到结果集合。结果集合不会扩容，必须有足够空间容纳源集合全部图元；已有图元将被覆盖。\n<p>适合在集合达到容量后分配更大集合，并高效地将要素转移到新集合。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection.DEFAULT_CAPACITY",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:42af33c676f68b5336bf12ecfd0d1fc580560826e4adec568243fcf9b3341a33",
      "text": "新集合各缓冲的默认容量，按元素数量计，例如顶点缓冲中的顶点数、图元缓冲中的图元数。此值为任意预设量，集合不可扩容；已知所需容量时，应在构造函数中指定各缓冲容量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#_modelMatrix",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dafdae78f13684907f6f9a43b6291a8d915022921f941ea13135302a75c734e9",
      "text": "将几何从模型坐标变换到世界坐标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#add",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:de1c719b6abb30b2efe4ae8656aaf23c15691ba73a67f2293daba1a29c386970",
      "text": "按给定选项向集合添加图元，并将 {@link BufferPrimitive} 实例绑定到该图元。提供 result 时使用该实例，否则新建实例。重复调用时，建议复用同一个 BufferPrimitive，避免每次分配新对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#boundingVolume",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fdd04cf4caeae6f98627faeb44a2c03b4156b6d6cb8645a9dc547d4aa9ea8540",
      "text": "集合中全部图元的世界空间包围体，包含显示和隐藏的图元。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#byteLength",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f4cadb12110fb3c8ea477940d60ce90e3b3ebf83d1d23b549872fad429c6a1de",
      "text": "集合拥有的全部缓冲的总字节数，包括 {@link primitiveCountMax} 分配的尚未使用空间，即使尚未在该空间添加图元。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#debugShowBoundingVolume",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:aada12c696fc8726817165d04c2ff7f8bc646a5a40f35a419053259d53655a5a",
      "text": "此属性仅供调试，不应在生产环境中使用，也未做性能优化。<p>绘制图元中每条绘制命令的包围球。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#destroy",
      "field": "description",
