      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0b1d4e54ffd91eec6ea89fcc13dd5a1d5765acef0dfc22295c5d6985fd2bbd60",
      "text": "存储位置值所用的分量数据类型。"
    },
    {
