      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8212cf7d0a9b57444c4491524d968179abbeb3630e549b4015b0c100251facd0",
      "text": "为 <code>true</code> 时，将整数位置值归一化，使完整整数范围映射至有符号的 [-1, 1] 或无符号的 [0, 1]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#primitiveCount",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2cf066b84fbd6aa61a524d2e4f2850ea10a1b7dc5beb6ec8ca2a728d25553584",
      "text": "集合中的图元数量，必须小于等于 {@link primitiveCountMax}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#primitiveCountMax",
