    },
    {
      "id": "BufferPrimitiveCollection#toJSON",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d674f67eb0841c971961cdeccf3c81f1000120d5d37cce6b5f02318193cb2ee0",
      "text": "返回表示集合的可 JSON 序列化数组。这种编码内存效率较低，通常仅用于调试和测试。"
